	METHOD method_1936 translatePathByModel (Ljavax/swing/tree/TreePath;Ljavax/swing/JTree;Ljavax/swing/JTree;)Ljavax/swing/tree/TreePath;
		COMMENT Walks the path down the source model recording each child index, then follows those same indices down the target model. Null as soon as either side does not have that child, so two trees of different shape simply do not link.
