		ARG 1 from
		ARG 2 to
	METHOD method_1937 restoreExpansionState ([ZLjavax/swing/JTree;)V
		COMMENT Row-indexed, so it is only meaningful against a tree whose model has not changed shape since captureExpansionState. Expanding row by row shifts the rows below it, which is why the two halves have to be used as a pair.
		ARG 0 state
		ARG 1 tree
